    <item>
      <title>RESIDENCY AT THE ICST STUDIO</title>
      <link>https://ambisonics.ch/residenzen/icst-studio-residences/</link>
      <guid>https://ambisonics.ch/residenzen/icst-studio-residences/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2099 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
        <author>johannes.schuett@zhdk.ch (Johannes Schuett)</author>
        <description>&lt;p&gt;Institute for Computer Music and Sound Technology / (ICST) Zurich University of the Arts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;artist-residencies-at-the-icst-composition-studio&#34;&gt;Artist residencies at the ICST Composition Studio&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the ICST composition studio, international artists create their 3D audio works using our Ambisonics plugins. The residencies enable creative work processes in the field of spatial sound design and electroacoustic composition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ambisonics.ch/residenzen/icst-studio-residences-2026/&#34;&gt;2026 Artist residencies at the ICST Composition Studio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ambisonics.ch/residenzen/icst-studio-residences-2025/&#34;&gt;2025 Artist residencies at the ICST Composition Studio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://icst-kompositionsstudio.ch/post/icst-artist-in-residency-im-kompositionsstudio&#34;&gt;Information about ICST studio residencies until 2024 can be found here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.zhdk.ch/forschung/icst/icst-air/residency-a-icst-studio-20727&#34;&gt;Residency A: ICST Studio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;font-size:9px;color:#9f9f9f;&#34;&gt;©2026 ICST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>

